  },
  "section": "3.287",
  "rulesText": "- Gain the following traits from the Core Warlock Traits table: Hit Point Die and training with Light armor.  \n- Gain the Warlock's level 1 features, which are listed in the Warlock Features table. See the multiclassing rules in “Character Creation” to determine your available spell slots."
}
